# Baby Daily Project Structure Guide

This is a Flutter baby daily tracking app that helps parents track their baby's routine through sessions (wake up to sleep cycles).

## Core Architecture

- **Entry Point**: [main.dart](mdc:lib/main.dart) - Sets up providers and navigation
- **Models**: Located in [lib/models/](mdc:lib/models/)
  - [session.dart](mdc:lib/models/session.dart) - Main session model with all baby activities
  - [milk_entry.dart](mdc:lib/models/milk_entry.dart) - Milk feeding tracking
  - [pee_entry.dart](mdc:lib/models/pee_entry.dart) - Pee activities
  - [poop_entry.dart](mdc:lib/models/poop_entry.dart) - Poop activities with consistency/color tracking
  - [vitamin_entry.dart](mdc:lib/models/vitamin_entry.dart) - Vitamin tracking

## State Management

- **Providers**: Located in [lib/providers/](mdc:lib/providers/)
  - [session_provider.dart](mdc:lib/providers/session_provider.dart) - Main session state management
  - [edit_session_provider.dart](mdc:lib/providers/edit_session_provider.dart) - Edit session state

## UI Structure

- **Screens**: Located in [lib/screens/](mdc:lib/screens/)
  - [session_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/session_screen.dart) - Current active session
  - [session_history_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/session_history_screen.dart) - Past sessions
  - [analytics_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/analytics_screen.dart) - Data visualization
  - [settings_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/settings_screen.dart) - App settings
  - [edit_session_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/edit_session_screen.dart) - Edit existing sessions

- **Shared Widgets**: Located in [lib/shared/widgets/](mdc:lib/shared/widgets/)
  - Reusable components for different entry types
  - Common UI patterns and utilities

## Services

- **Database**: [database_service.dart](mdc:lib/services/database_service.dart) - SQLite operations
- **Backup**: [backup_service.dart](mdc:lib/services/backup_service.dart) - Data backup/restore
- **Excel**: [excel_service.dart](mdc:lib/services/excel_service.dart) - Export functionality

## Key Dependencies

- `provider` - State management
- `sqflite` - Local database
- `image_picker` - Photo capture
- `excel` - Data export
- `intl` - Date/time formatting
